                            <keyword start="1415712/25s" duration="12800/2500s" value="214 this is just all new, for me. and it would be for my family too."/>
                            <keyword start="283168/5s" duration="8600/2500s" value="215 i just had to get my head around it."/>
                            <keyword start="1415926/25s" duration="7400/2500s" value="216 why didn’t you just tell me that? "/>
                            <keyword start="56640s" duration="25600/2500s" value="217 i panicked, and i shouldn’t have. because really, you being you, which is a totally rad girl,"/>
                            <keyword start="1416247/25s" duration="19200/2500s" value="218 isn’t that complicated and  all that matters is that"/>
                            <keyword start="1416439/25s" duration="18100/2500s" value="219 i seriously, seriously like you. and i don’t want to miss out."/>
